    description: "Follow-up to WI-bapal-sanok-vujoj-jisub-duzor-dojuz-misiz-fudok. With --trace-deps, installed dependency source (e.g. thc_dev deps/: 81 Mix packages) is re-parsed on every cold survey and the whole results entry is keyed by repo state. A package pinned in mix.lock / package-lock.json / composer.lock / go.sum / Gemfile.lock at a version is identical across runs and across repos, so its parsed symbols/edges could be cached once under <ecosystem>/<name>@<version> and spliced in. Open questions: cross-file resolution between first-party and dependency symbols happens after parsing, so only per-file analyzer output is cacheable; git/path deps (thc_dev heroicons) have no version pin and need a content hash instead."  # 3dc8
    fields: {}  # 3dc8
